// {"files":[{"path":"\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\danie\\OneDrive\\github-repos\\drosemann\\README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":27,"oldLines":7,"newStart":27,"newLines":8,"lines":[" Under my old alias MineHub I published SpigotMC plugins at https://www.spigotmc.org/resources/authors/minehub.1035036/"," Since 10 September 2023 I've been part of Emergency Response: Crestwood County, a Roblox roleplay project."," I also built a Raspberry Pi AI plant monitoring project with sensors and AI, and I spend time on hardware hacking and AI security.","-I also built cooperating-screen for cross-device screen sharing with Flutter, WebRTC and a Node.js signaling service: https://github.com/drosemann/cooperating-screen","+I also built cooperating-screen for cross-device screen sharing with Flutter, WebRTC and a Node.js signaling service, aimed at real co-working with multi-user control and app-level sharing instead of plain desktop mirroring, with a browser web client and Docker-ready signaling: https://github.com/drosemann/cooperating-screen","+On the satire side I built TraumaLang, my unbenchmarkable IT satire programming language written in C with no dependencies beyond libc and GCC, which compiles .tl files to C and comes with an --explain mode, a Python-to-TraumaLang rewriter and deliberately endless enterprise constructs documented as jokes rather than features: https://github.com/drosemann/TraumaLang"," After over 2,000 gaming videos I made 15 videos in the Theo Browne style, archived at https://github.com/drosemann/drosemann/tree/main/theo-browne-era-video-style"," All of my domains are with netcup: d5niel.de for my portfolio, which will run on ForgeCMS (https://github.com/drosemann/forgecms) in the future, shadowunity.de for my Minecraft server, and hosting-club.de, a former hosting forum."," For writing itself I use ed-docs, an offline-first Markdown workspace with ed/vi habits like i, a, Esc and :w: https://github.com/drosemann/ed-docs"]}]}]}
